&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading Silicon Valley investors, &lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31a93d43-caca-80de-b81c-001cca9095e7 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Peregrine helps public safety organizations, state and local and governments, federal agencies&lt;/span&gt;, and private-sector institutions address society’s challenges with unprecedented speed and accuracy. Our AI-enabled platform turns siloed and disconnected data into operational intelligence — instantly surfacing mission-critical information to empower better, faster decisions that improve outcomes at every touchpoint. Today Peregrine supports hundreds of customers across 30+ states and two countries, serving more than 125 million people — and we’re amplifying our impact as we expand into the enterprise and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Peregrine opened its UK office in March 2026 and is focused on bringing the platform to UK policing and adjacent public safety markets. This is a ground-floor opportunity to shape how Peregrine goes to market in the UK. The role is hybrid, based in London, with regular national travel to forces across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;&quot;first&quot; &lt;/strong&gt;Account Executive for UK Public Safety/Law Enforcement, we&#39;re looking for a proven senior seller who can strategically assess, prioritize, plan, and sell to police forces and public safety agencies across the United Kingdom. You will meet and exceed sales goals through prospecting, qualifying, managing, and closing high-value and highly visible sales opportunities, owning force relationships end to end. You will deliver senior-level presentations and demonstrations to Chief Officer teams, Police and Crime Commissioners, and force digital and data leadership, highlighting Peregrine&#39;s advantages, features, and functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee the entire sales cycle, from first engagement through formal procurement to contract signature and onboarding, collaborating closely with cross-functional teams across deployment strategy, marketing, legal, and operations in both the UK and the US. You will be the trusted advisor to the customer, understanding their existing and future technology roadmap to position Peregrine&#39;s solution. Because the UK is a 0-to-1 market for Peregrine, you will also identify, develop, and document GTM best practices alongside the Head of UK &amp;amp; European Markets, helping to build the playbook rather than inheriting one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business and revenue growth within UK policing, managing the entire sales lifecycle from prospecting through procurement to deployment handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate UK public sector procurement end to end, including competitive tenders under the Procurement Act 2023 and routes to market such as Crown Commercial Service agreements, G-Cloud and the Digital Marketplace, and BlueLight Commercial frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strategic relationships with Chief Constables and Chief Officer teams, PCCs and their offices, force CIOs/CDOs and heads of intelligence, and relevant national bodies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, clearly articulating how Peregrine&#39;s technology addresses mission-critical operational challenges in investigative, intelligence, and strategic contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choreograph the sales process internally, coordinating subject matter experts including senior advisors, solution engineers, and deployment strategists to move opportunities to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a territory growth strategy for UK policing in collaboration with leadership: identify priority forces, diagnose customer workflow challenges, and find the key buying stakeholders who will ensure accelerated success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide detailed market intelligence and customer feedback to product teams so Peregrine&#39;s solutions continuously align with UK policing needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new customers through onboarding and partner with relationship owners to identify and execute expansion opportunities within existing UK accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About You&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are outcome-focused and can expertly navigate complex interpersonal scenarios with curiosity and appreciation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy guiding the customer over the finish line and are resilient and steadfast in your goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with a high level of transparency, tenacity, and ownership of the opportunities in front of you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in the exploration of developing positive outcomes in lesser-known spaces and are energized by building in a new market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fearless navigator in ambiguous circumstances and can be flexible and creative as you explore all possibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a thoughtful and empathetic listener; you devote the time to understanding a customer&#39;s challenges and can generate tailored approaches based on what best serves their needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can make advanced technology feel human; you are the bridge, the translator, the shepherd between technology and people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a lifelong learner, willing to learn anything to achieve your goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We Look For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of field sales experience in enterprise software/SaaS; experience with data integration, analytics, or intelligence platforms in law enforcement or public safety strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of success selling into net-new, complex UK public sector accounts, demonstrated by overachievement of quota and strong customer references&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with UK police procurement, budgets, and funding routes, including Home Office programmes and force and PCC budget cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships and credibility within UK policing; prior policing career experience (officer or staff) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a complex, consultative sales process from 0 to 1 in a new market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and comfort negotiating and closing legal agreements with customers and supporting new customers through onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for Non-Police Personnel Vetting Level 3 (NPPV3); this typically requires at least three years of continuous UK residency. Willingness to undergo further national security vetting (SC) if required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive-level verbal and written communication, presentation, and relationship management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the UK with willingness to travel regularly to forces across the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual compensation is influenced by a wide array of factors including but not limited to skill set, level of experience, certifications or licenses, and specific work location. Information on the benefits offered is&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.io/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot; data-reactroot=&quot;&quot;&gt;Peregrine Technologies is committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We celebrate diversity and are a proud equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading Silicon Valley investors, &lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31a93d43-caca-80de-b81c-001cca9095e7 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Peregrine helps public safety organizations, state and local and governments, federal agencies&lt;/span&gt;, and private-sector institutions address society’s challenges with unprecedented speed and accuracy. Our AI-enabled platform turns siloed and disconnected data into operational intelligence — instantly surfacing mission-critical information to empower better, faster decisions that improve outcomes at every touchpoint. Today Peregrine supports hundreds of customers across 30+ states and two countries, serving more than 125 million people — and we’re amplifying our impact as we expand into the enterprise and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Peregrine builds an end-to-end intelligence platform. As the&lt;strong&gt; Applied AI Engineering Lead, &lt;/strong&gt;you will own how artificial intelligence is applied, evaluated, and operationalized across our product, turning complex data into trusted, explainable, and high-impact capabilities used in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is about production AI in high-consequence environments. You’ll lead to develop AI-powered features that help customers detect risk, surface insights, and make faster, better decisions while maintaining high reliability, transparency, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build AI-Powered Product Capabilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and deployment of customer facing AI features across Peregrine’s platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate real operational problems into deployable AI-powered solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with Product, Deployment Strategists, and other Engineering teams to integrate AI into core workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI/ML Foundations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and guide fine tuning strategies and reinforcement learning to improve decision quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make principled tradeoffs between classical ML, deep learning, and LLM-based approaches based on accuracy, latency, and risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI Infrastructure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Peregrine’s AI infrastructure, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and inference pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model serving, versioning, and rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration with real-time and batch data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure models are observable, scalable, secure, and cost-effective in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet enterprise and government requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Evaluation, Trust, and Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and operate robust evaluation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish quality standards that reflect real-world decision impact, not just model accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own monitoring, drift detection, and failure analysis for deployed models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing Applied AI/ML team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for applied AI across Peregrine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with executive leadership on AI strategy, roadmap, and responsible deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience shipping AI-powered features into production, ideally in enterprise or mission critical environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with model fine tuning (LLMs or deep learning models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical exposure to reinforcement learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in designing and operating AI/ML infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct ownership of model evaluation, experimentation, and quality measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals as a lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Strong Plus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large scale and/or real-time data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in domains where trust, explainability, and reliability matter (e.g., public sector, security, healthcare, finance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led software engineering teams before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI features are deeply embedded in Peregrine’s core product and relied on by customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is applied to generate outcomes that are measurable, monitored, and improving over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make AI a force multiplier both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary + Benefits + Equity (if applicable) + Bonus (if applicable)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$320,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual compensation is influenced by a wide array of factors including but not limited to skill set, level of experience, certifications or licenses, and specific work location. Information on the benefits offered is&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.io/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot; data-reactroot=&quot;&quot;&gt;Peregrine Technologies is committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We celebrate diversity and are a proud equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading Silicon Valley investors, &lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31a93d43-caca-80de-b81c-001cca9095e7 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Peregrine helps public safety organizations, state and local and governments, federal agencies&lt;/span&gt;, and private-sector institutions address society’s challenges with unprecedented speed and accuracy. Our AI-enabled platform turns siloed and disconnected data into operational intelligence — instantly surfacing mission-critical information to empower better, faster decisions that improve outcomes at every touchpoint. Today Peregrine supports hundreds of customers across 30+ states and two countries, serving more than 125 million people — and we’re amplifying our impact as we expand into the enterprise and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a team of public service entrepreneurs who are passionate about solving hard problems. We trust and help each other, and believe empathy, curiosity, integrity, courage, and excellent execution are key to building impactful software. If mission-focused work is your north star, come build with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Commercial Counsel to join Peregrine’s legal team. This role will report to Peregrine’s Associate General Counsel and will wear a number of hats on the team and gain exposure to the full spectrum of in-house practice at a fast-scaling technology company. This role will support commercial contracts across the business but will also help advise on corporate, compliance, privacy, IP, and legal operations questions in partnership with the in-house legal team and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work day-to-day with Sales, Finance, Contracts, Customer Delivery, Marketing, and a number of other departments within the company. The role suits a commercial contracts attorney who learns quickly, is adaptable, and is interested in broadening their skills as an in-house generalist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate the agreements behind our sales, partnerships, and customer delivery, as well as the software and services that support the business, including technology licensing, software, vendor, reseller, strategic partnership, and data sharing agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide practical advice to business teams on IP, data privacy, security, AI, and software licensing questions relating to Peregrine’s business and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review marketing collateral and marketing-related agreements, such as agency, sponsorship, and event contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Legal Operations and Contracts to build and evolve playbooks, templates, and policies to scale with the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and educate business stakeholders on changes in the laws and regulations that affect Peregrine’s business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and counsel stakeholders on ad hoc legal, compliance, and operational matters as they arise, and over time build depth in the areas most relevant to Peregrine’s business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Juris Doctor (J.D.) degree and active admission to practice in at least one U.S. jurisdiction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in commercial/transactional legal work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technology transactions or general commercial contracting preferred (SaaS agreements, licensing, vendor contracts, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about new areas of legal practice and a desire to broaden your skill set to operate across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound commercial judgment, and the ability to explain legal risk to non-lawyers in plain terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, low-ego, collaborative communicator and team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: San Francisco, New York City, or Washington, D.C. Employees in this role are expected to be in the office 4 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary + Benefits + Equity (if applicable) + Bonus (if applicable)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual compensation is influenced by a wide array of factors including but not limited to skill set, level of experience, certifications or licenses, and specific work location. Information on the benefits offered is&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.io/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
