&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The position is field-based and while does not have an in-office requirement, you are expected to be on site with customers 50-60% of the time - regions include San Francisco, Sonoma, and Solano Counties.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
