&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Customer Advocate to own all customer relationships throughout the contract. You’ll be the primary interface between our customers and our team, representing the voice of the customer to our engineers and supporting the customer with new updates, workflows, and features to the platform. This involves interpreting multiple and complex data sources to ensure all users are working in Peregrine to the best of their ability, including dashboards, metrics, and onsite visits to build deep relationships with all agency stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
