&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Chief Marketing Officer (CMO), you will lead an established team of creatives to refine our brand design systems, bring our product and customers to life, and solve complex brand challenges in close partnership with the product, engineering, sales and executive leadership teams. This year, Peregrine has been expanding into new global regions and segments, with commercial businesses increasingly adopting Peregrine’s full-stack AI and data integration platform. You are a strategic thinker who understands how to bridge the gap between sophisticated technology and human-centric storytelling, particularly given the differing priorities across diverse customer segments.&lt;/p&gt;
