&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Peregrine Deployment Strategists are the high-velocity vanguard, transforming how the most critical organizations in the world operate. This is not about passive advisory, maintaining legacy systems, or watching from the sidelines. It is about stepping directly onto the front lines of consequence, bringing intense momentum, and solving problems that fundamentally shape society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To do this work, you operate with relentless drive and fluidity. Within the span of a single day, you will move from deep data engineering and system architecture to high-stakes executive strategy and rapid product innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Peregrine, you take complete ownership of mission impact. We embed shoulder-to-shoulder with frontline practitioners and executive leaders to turn chaotic operational environments into decisive, data-driven action—accelerating critical response, strengthening essential infrastructure, and modernizing the institutions that underpin everyday life. We are building a high-speed, ambitious team with the energy, courage, and technical command to reinvent how the world’s most vital organizations execute their missions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate on the front lines with radical autonomy, relentless momentum, and high speed. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed on the front lines:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on-site with world-shaping institutions to internalize their highest-stakes challenges, understand their culture, and accelerate their operational velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer dynamic, mission-critical systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Move far beyond static reporting. Architect robust data models, live pipelines, and automated intelligence workflows using Peregrine’s platform and AI primitives to unlock immediate operational power.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invent what’s next:&lt;/strong&gt; Anticipate needs before they are articulated, rapidly prototyping and shipping visionary solutions that revolutionize how our partners lead and decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge the technical and the strategic:&lt;/strong&gt; Move effortlessly between deep technical problem-solving with engineering teams and briefing executive leadership on mission-defining initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forge unshakable trust:&lt;/strong&gt; Earn deep credibility inside historically technology-resistant environments through flawless execution, humility, and undeniable real-world results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel platform evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the vital link between field operations and core Engineering, Product, and Design teams—turning frontline breakthroughs into scalable, generational software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer new frontiers:&lt;/strong&gt; Chart Peregrine’s expansion into vital new sectors and operational domains, establishing durable advantages and expanding our reach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live where the mission happens:&lt;/strong&gt; Travel regularly to stand shoulder-to-shoulder with our partners when and where it matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Look For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–6+ years of mission-driven technical execution with proven track record in client-facing environments deploying enterprise platforms, engineering data systems, or tackling complex, high-stakes technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data engineering &amp;amp; technical rigor, &lt;strong&gt;s&lt;/strong&gt;trong command of SQL and Python, with the ability to build, optimize, and scale complex data pipelines, system integrations, and real-time operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relentless bias for action:&lt;/strong&gt; An appetite for high velocity, decisive problem-solving, and the hunger to drive outcomes in fast-moving, high-gravity environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspiring communication:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to convey complex technical concepts with clarity, conviction, and resonance across diverse audiences, from data engineers to agency heads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Data Engineering, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presence &amp;amp; Velocity:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement and commitment to be in office 4+ days per week at our New York City office, collaborating in person to push the boundaries of what our team can achieve together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and passion to travel approximately 50% of the time, often on short notice, to lead deployments on-site.&lt;/li&gt;
