&lt;p&gt;Peregrine is looking for a GTM Systems Analyst to support and maintain the systems architecture behind our growing go-to-market organization. You&#39;ll be a hands-on partner to 200+ users across Sales, Marketing, Customer Advocates, Delivery Services, and Finance. As the front-line owner of day-to-day requests across Salesforce and connected tools, you&#39;ll troubleshoot issues, manage access, execute enhancements, and escalate complex or cross-functional work to Revenue Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends responsive support with structured execution against Peregrine&#39;s longer-term GTM systems roadmap - contributing to projects through a sprint-based workflow, running recurring data-governance work, and spotting opportunities for automation, documentation, training, and self-service. You&#39;ll thrive here if you enjoy solving problems, can balance urgent needs with planned work, and want to deepen your Salesforce and GTM systems expertise in a complex, evolving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You respond to team needs, take timely action to support business outcomes, and collaborate constructively with teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders and know when to involve a more senior teammate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can triage competing requests, assess urgency and business impact, and stay organized in a fast-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You troubleshoot day-to-day issues and distinguish between a systems issue, a need for user guidance, and a broader process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
