&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own revenue recognition under ASC 606 across subscription and usage-based arrangements, including performance obligations, SSP, contract modifications, variable consideration, and multi-year or option-year structures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Interpret ambiguity in new and emerging revenue arrangements, including AI-based revenue components under U.S. GAAP, and turn it into audit-ready, defensible accounting policies and technical memos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the monthly and quarterly revenue close, including the revenue waterfall, deferred revenue, unbilled receivables, and related reconciliations, plus reporting that provides insights on the performance of the business, with a predictable close calendar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
