&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The position is based remotely in Tampa, Florida with weekly onsite visits/travel required across that region and surrounding areas. Location is subject to change to align with business need.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
