&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in dbt, modern data warehouses (Snowflake/BigQuery), and orchestration tools (Airflow, Prefect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BI tools such as Looker, Hex, Mode, Sigma, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and business sense — you know how to balance technical purity with speed, scalability, and impact&lt;/li&gt;
