&lt;li&gt;Maintain compliance with domestic and international payroll regulations by staying current on federal, state, local, and international payroll requirements, ensuring accurate tax filings, statutory deductions, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage employee payroll inquiries by providing timely and accurate support on payroll, deductions, tax withholdings, and related questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee payroll reporting by preparing payroll, tax, and benefits-related reports for People Ops, Finance, and leadership. Partner with Accounting on payroll reconciliations and audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline payroll administration processes by identifying opportunities to improve workflows, automate manual tasks, and increase efficiency as Peregrine continues to scale domestically and internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support payroll and tax audits by maintaining accurate, complete, and audit-ready records, ensuring compliance with company policies and applicable regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
