&lt;li&gt;3+ years of payroll expertise: Strong knowledge of U.S. payroll regulations and working knowledge of UK and Canadian payroll requirements, including statutory deductions and tax reporting**. Experience with Rippling is required.**&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accuracy across payroll calculations, reporting, tax filings, and employee records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and resolve payroll issues while adapting to changing regulations and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively manage payroll schedules, reporting deadlines, and competing priorities across multiple jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
