&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Platform team owns the foundation that every product team at Peregrine builds on. Our job is to make Peregrine&#39;s infrastructure fast, resilient, secure, and cost-efficient, while making it easy for other engineers to ship safely and quickly on top of it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We believe great infrastructure is invisible when&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;working and clearly communicated when it&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t. We hold ourselves to a high bar on reliability and security, and we treat other engineering teams as our customers, investing in tooling, documentation, and self-service paths that reduce their toil.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our growing Platform team and help us execute on scaling Peregrine&#39;s cloud footprint.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;build and ship initiatives that improve performance and reliability, reduce infrastructure cost, strengthen our security posture, and make the platform more developer-friendly, often all at once.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is hands-on:&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;take ownership of moderately complex infrastructure problems and drive them from design through to production, exercising good judgment about how your work should fit into the broader platform.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;juggle several priorities without much day-to-day guidance, flag&amp;nbsp;risks&amp;nbsp;and status changes early, and weigh cost and effort tradeoffs when choosing how to implement something.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;also start lending a hand to less experienced engineers and weighing in on technical decisions beyond your own immediate work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Representative problems you&#39;ll work on include: standing up new regions and customer environments with minimal manual work as Peregrine&#39;s footprint grows; building and shipping autoscaling and right-sizing systems that cut cloud spend without sacrificing headroom; strengthening reliability and incident response for mission-critical services so outages are rare and fast to resolve; hardening platform security controls to meet the compliance bar our public-sector customers require; and building paved-road tooling that lets product teams deploy, observe, and debug their services without needing deep infra expertise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
