&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our stack is constantly evolving but is built on AWS GovCloud, Apache Iceberg, Apache Spark, Apache Kafka, Airflow, Kubernetes, and more.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
