&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading Silicon Valley investors, &lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31a93d43-caca-80de-b81c-001cca9095e7 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Peregrine helps public safety organizations, state and local and governments, federal agencies&lt;/span&gt;, and private-sector institutions address society’s challenges with unprecedented speed and accuracy. Our AI-enabled platform turns siloed and disconnected data into operational intelligence — instantly surfacing mission-critical information to empower better, faster decisions that improve outcomes at every touchpoint. Today Peregrine supports hundreds of customers across 30+ states and two countries, serving more than 125 million people — and we’re amplifying our impact as we expand into the enterprise and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As VP of Finance, you will be responsible for building the financial engine behind Peregrine&#39;s next stage of growth, including our long-range model, the annual operating plan, forecasting process, and the analysis behind our most consequential investment decisions. You will also scale and develop a high-performance team. The ideal candidate has worked in both the ambiguity of a high-growth startup and the rigor of a mature private or public company and will help build the financial infrastructure required to support the business as it grows. You will report to the CFO and partner closely with the Controller, who owns accounting operations, and with leaders across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and continuously evolve Peregrine&#39;s multi-year model, translating strategic goals into a driver-based financial roadmap that leadership can use to make high-quality decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead the company-wide annual operating plan, partnering with department heads to build driver-based budgets and headcount plans tied to company goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a monthly budget versus actuals cadence, diagnose variance drivers, hold leaders accountable to plan, and work with them to identify mitigation options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the forecasting methodology and cadence for a multi-segment GTM focused on both public-sector and commercial enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a view on Peregrine&#39;s unit economics across product lines and segments, with a specific focus on gross margin, FDE costs, infrastructure and compute costs, CAC and payback by segment, and net dollar retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build financial cases for our largest bets, including expansion to new segments, investment in new product lines, international entry, and pricing and packaging changes, among others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own financial reporting and narrative for the CFO, executive team, Board, and investors, and prepare analysis required for future financings, strategic transactions, and IPO readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop the FP&amp;amp;A team, and build it in an AI-native way, automating lower-level activities and freeing up time to focus on higher-value work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive finance experience, including an analytical foundation at an investment bank, private equity firm, or top-tier consulting firm, followed by strategic finance or FP&amp;amp;A leadership at a high-growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a company-wide annual planning cycle, including driving cross-functional alignment and managing the process to a timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional financial modeling capability paired with hands-on data fluency. You should be comfortable pulling your own data and working in SQL or the equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in complex revenue models, ideally spanning subscription, consumption, and professional services, with a clear view of how each behaves in gross margin and cash flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should be AI-native, with examples of how you’ve eliminated recurring manual work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional executive communication. You are able to articulate complex topics and focus on what matters at the appropriate altitude for CEO and Board-level discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to recruit, manage, and develop quantitative talent, and build a high-performance team and strong culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with government contracting, regulated customer environments, or long procurement cycles is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international expansion is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to work in our San Francisco office 4x/week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary + Benefits + Equity (if applicable) + Bonus (if applicable)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$260,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$340,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual compensation is influenced by a wide array of factors including but not limited to skill set, level of experience, certifications or licenses, and specific work location. Information on the benefits offered is&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.io/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot; data-reactroot=&quot;&quot;&gt;Peregrine Technologies is committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We celebrate diversity and are a proud equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backed by leading Silicon Valley investors, &lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31a93d43-caca-80de-b81c-001cca9095e7 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Peregrine helps public safety organizations, state and local and governments, federal agencies&lt;/span&gt;, and private-sector institutions address society’s challenges with unprecedented speed and accuracy. Our AI-enabled platform turns siloed and disconnected data into operational intelligence — instantly surfacing mission-critical information to empower better, faster decisions that improve outcomes at every touchpoint. Today Peregrine supports hundreds of customers across 30+ states and two countries, serving more than 125 million people — and we’re amplifying our impact as we expand into the enterprise and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Web Engineer on the marketing team, you&#39;ll drive growth by building the mechanisms that scale it: our marketing website (&lt;a href=&quot;http://peregrine.io&quot;&gt;peregrine.io&lt;/a&gt;), content automation, and the internal workflows behind our digital growth experiments. The website is your primary focus. It&#39;s both an external surface to clearly communicate our value props to a variety of audiences, and an internal tool for scale and automation. You&#39;ll own it end to end, the Sanity instance and the front-end alike, and build the systems a modern marketing team runs on: signal ingestion, personalization, content production, and workflow automation. Working alongside growth marketing, product marketing, content, and brand, you&#39;ll build interactive experiences that stand out and run experiments that move the metrics that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value ownership and collaboration. You&#39;ll own major features end to end and work closely with the team to ship them. Empathy and humility matter here. You&#39;ll partner directly with marketing and design as we solve real problems. Perseverance and creativity are how we execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the entire website: the Sanity instance, the front-end, and every page, component, and content workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a content management system of reusable copy and visual elements that ship to web, ads, print, and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build signal ingestion and personalization that tailor experiences to a broad set of audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build translation management workflows that make localization fast and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate internal marketing workflows so the team moves faster with less manual work, such as building personalized web/landing page pipelines, asset creation automation, signal generation/segmentation, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run growth experiments across our web properties to drive conversion, visibility, and personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and optimize HubSpot, GTA, and related platforms for tracking, lead generation, and audience segmentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver near-instant load times, strong technical SEO/AEO/GEO, and consistent performance across browsers and devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How we&#39;ll measure success&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site performance.&lt;/strong&gt; Speed, reliability, and quality across every property.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visibility from technical SEO.&lt;/strong&gt; Measurable gains in organic discovery and answer-engine presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalized content at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Content systems that scale with the business, increase engagement and drive conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You treat marketing as engineering. You automate the manual and measure what you ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design and build. You have taste, and you can ship what you envision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write clean, maintainable code and reach for tools that sharpen your output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think in systems: personalization, analytics, content delivery, all tuned for engagement and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You track industry trends and bring back what&#39;s relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we look for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Sanity, Vercel, React, and Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Git,&lt;/strong&gt; plus strong web fundamentals (TypeScript, HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and understanding of privacy and accessibility standards for web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building signal ingestion, personalization, content production, and internal workflow automation for a marketing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running growth experiments to drive conversion, visibility, and personalization across audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong design and development fundamentals. You move fluidly between the two.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in performance optimization and technical SEO/AEO, and familiarity with marketing analytics and conversion tracking tools (Amplitude, GA4, GTM, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working understanding of localization and translation management workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with marketing/growth teams as a primary stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 5 years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;ve learned people hesitate to apply without an exact number of years. What matters most is the experiences you&#39;ve had and the skills you&#39;ve built. Around five years feels right. If you have fewer and meet the rest, apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary + Benefits + Equity (if applicable) + Bonus (if applicable)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$192,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual compensation is influenced by a wide array of factors including but not limited to skill set, level of experience, certifications or licenses, and specific work location. Information on the benefits offered is&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://peregrine.io/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
